WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.320
 Thank you for coming along with me today, human.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:26.240
 Today, I'll be teaching you how to hunt like a dragon since you're so inept on your own.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:34.600
 So, I think you need the extra help, because you don't seem to know how to hunt by yourself at all.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:40.560
 Since you're with me, I guess I'll teach you how to hunt.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:51.680
 Not because I like you, but because you're just so pathetic, you just, you really need some help.

00:00:51.680 --> 00:01:11.220
 Yeah. So, you brought your supplies? You forgot your fangs. Oh yeah, humans don't have fangs. What about your claws? None of that either.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:15.940
 What am I going to do with you, you idiot?

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:17.920
 Okay.

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:25.260
 Came all the way out here for you to tell me that you can't hunt at all.

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:30.060
 And I can't even teach you because you don't have your supplies.

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:35.280
 Well, it's getting rather cold out.

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:38.440
 So, we better hurry back.

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:43.440
 What's that up ahead?

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:55.600
 Oh no! Human, I found a dragon egg!

00:01:55.600 --> 00:02:07.600
 What are we going to do?

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:11.600
 We can't eat it, you idiot!

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:24.600
 Dragon eggs are rare and valuable. Do you realize how difficult it is for one of us to have an egg?

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:28.600
 Well, I'm not about to explain it to you.

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:48.600
 This poor thing, is out here in the cold all by himself. We have to help it.

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:08.600
 Here, take my hand. We're going to find shelter.

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:17.360
 I'm not holding your hand because I like you

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:20.580
 I didn't want you to get lost in the storm

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:24.060
 Shut up

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:25.640
 It wasn't

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:26.880
 It didn't

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:29.540
 Don't take it that way, okay?

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:34.360
 If I lose you then

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.640
 If I get lost in the storm

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:37.960
 I won't have anything to eat

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.960
 So, I need you just in case

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:47.960
 I think this cape will do for proper shelter

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:49.960
 Let me light a fire

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:01.960
 There, nice and toasty

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:08.960
 As for this little egg, I found some bedding to put it in

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:12.960
 Soft and fluffy

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.960
 That seems perfect, doesn't it?

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.960
 Okay, so what we have to do

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.960
 to warm up a dragon egg

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:29.960
 is we have to get really close

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:30.960
 and cuddle up

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:33.960
 and make sure it stays warm

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:40.720
 All right, get close to the egg, human.

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:59.960
 Your face is really close to mine.

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:05.140
 Your tummy, your breath smells bad

00:05:05.140 --> 00:05:09.060
 I'm just trying to keep the egg warm

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:12.040
 It's not like I like being next to you like this

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:14.840
 Please don't get the wrong idea

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:44.360
 I can feel the egg warming up

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:52.360
 It seems like there's still life

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:54.560
 I'm so glad

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:56.440
 Thank you for helping me

00:05:56.440 --> 00:06:03.640
 I mean, thank you for being a decent creature

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:10.920
 and doing the bare minimum requirement for being good

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:21.740
 It's not like other dragons lack empathy

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:33.740
 and humans are some sort of amazing, loving creatures

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:43.740
 creatures that care, creatures that seem to like to help others

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:53.980
 That might be why I like you so much.

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:56.420
 Shoulda.

00:06:57.920 --> 00:07:01.240
 I'm just trying to tell you how I feel.

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:07.480
 Don't make me regret this.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:18.040
 I guess I never knew that humans had empathy like this.

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:23.020
 So, I guess I have to thank you

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:25.900
 Thank you, human

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:27.360
 For helping

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:36.780
 Mama dragons usually sing to their eggs

00:07:36.980 --> 00:07:38.980
 And it helps them hatch

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:40.420
 So

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:44.900
 I think I'm going to sing to the egg if you don't mind

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:46.740
 Shut up

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:49.060
 I know my singing isn't that good

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:56.740
 This is for the egg, not for you, okay?

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:49.720
 Thank you.

00:08:49.740 --> 00:09:19.720
 I'm going to go to the next one.

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:49.720
 So, let's go.

00:09:49.740 --> 00:10:19.720
 . . .

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:44.920
 I think it worked. Listen. Can you hear that? It's heartbeat. It's alive. And I think it's going to hatch.

00:10:49.740 --> 00:11:00.740
 Hmm. We did it, human. You and I? Together? We?

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:18.740
 Thank you. Listen to that little heartbeat. You're going to be okay, little guy.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:31.280
 Thank you

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:35.440
 I think it's about to help you

00:11:48.740 --> 00:12:11.740
 It hatched, he's so cute, oh my goodness, thank you human, just for helping me hatch this egg, can we keep it?

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:17.740
 I think you'll make a good parent to this little dragon weasel baby.

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:27.740
 Thank you for helping me. Let's go!
